,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Colbert County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids the January to February pair came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 165% of normal in May to June and 48% in November to December. In 2026 so far, February to March sat at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids. All 8 grids had their driest year in 2007, and grid 17568 got 59% of normal that year.</p>"}
